# These scripts run on the Jetsons and the Spark. A CRLF checkout makes bash
# die with "$'\r': command not found" on the very first line, and the error
# names neither the file nor the reason. core.autocrlf=true keeps the blob LF,
# but that is a setting on one machine - this is the rule travelling with the
# repo, and it also covers copying the file over instead of cloning it.
*.sh text eol=lf
